#. module: stock_quant_lot_assign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/stock_quant_lot_assign/models/stock_quant.py:0
msgid "Lot assignment"
msgstr "Asignación de lote/nº de serie"

#. module: stock_quant_lot_assign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/stock_quant_lot_assign/models/stock_quant.py:0
msgid ""
"None of the selected quants can be processed. Only quants without lot, with "
"positive quantity in internal or transit locations, of products tracked by "
"lots or serial numbers are processed."
msgstr ""
"No se puede procesar ninguna de las líneas seleccionadas. Solo se procesan "
"líneas sin número de lote, con una cantidad positiva en ubicaciones internas "
"o de tránsito, de productos cuyo seguimiento se realiza por lotes o números de serie."
#. module: stock_quant_lot_assign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/stock_quant_lot_assign/models/stock_quant.py:0
msgid "Only inventory administrators can assign lots to quants."
msgstr "Solo los administradores de inventario pueden asignar lotes a los quants."

#. module: stock_quant_lot_assign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_quant_lot_assign.field_res_config_settings__quant_assign_lot_prefix
msgid ""
"Prefix of the lots created when assigning a lot to quants without lot. A "
"sequential number is added after it."
msgstr ""

#. module: stock_quant_lot_assign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:stock_quant_lot_assign.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"Prefix of the lots created with the 'Assign Lot' action on quants without "
"lot"
msgstr ""
"Prefijo de los lotes que se crea al asignar un lote a los quants sin lote."
#. module: stock_quant_lot_assign
#: model:ir.model,name:stock_quant_lot_assign.model_stock_quant
msgid "Quants"
msgstr ""

#. module: stock_quant_lot_assign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/stock_quant_lot_assign/models/stock_quant.py:0
msgid ""
"The following quants of products tracked by serial numbers do not have a whole quantity, so one serial number per unit cannot be created:\n"
"%(quants)s"
msgstr ""
"Los siguientes quants de productos cuyo seguimiento se realiza mediante números de serie no tienen una cantidad completa, por lo que no es posible crear un número de serie por unidad:\n %(quants)s"
#. module: stock_quant_lot_assign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/stock_quant_lot_assign/models/stock_quant.py:0
msgid ""
"The reservations of the following quants cannot be undone, probably because their operations are already picked. Unpick or process those operations first:\n"
"%(quants)s"
msgstr ""
"Las reservas de los siguientes quants no se pueden anular, probablemente porque sus operaciones ya están asignadas. Desasigna o procesa primero esas operaciones:\n %(quants)s"
